            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 21–30</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the notes below. Write <strong>NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div><strong>Archaeology Course</strong></div><ul><li>Can be combined with any other subject except {{21}}.</li><li>Has three {{22}} modules in the first semester.</li></ul><p>Module 1</p><p>Title: {{23}} · Lecturer: Dr Morris</p><p>Learning method: Lectures and practical sessions</p><p>Content (based on processes): recording, {{24}}, interpretation, display</p><p>Assessment: By {{25}}</p><p>Module 2</p><p>Title: {{26}} · Lecturer: Prof. Elliot</p><p>Content: {{27}} and development of built environments</p><p>Assessment: By {{28}} examination</p><p>Module 3</p><p>Title: Method and Science · Lecturer: Dr Thompson</p><p>Content: Standard techniques in fieldwork and analysis</p><p>Learning method: 50% lab work, 50% {{29}}</p><p>Site survey at end of module (the {{30}} is to be announced later)</p></div>",
            "maxWords": 3
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "number": 4,
        "title": "Part 4",
        "instructionsHtml": "<p>Listen and answer questions 31–40.</p>",
        "groups": [
          {
            "id": "part-4-group-1",
            "type": "mcq",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 31–33 <span style=\"font-weight:400;\">(Digital technology &amp; young people)</span></p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 31,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What impact does Marc Prensky believe digital technology has had on young people?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "It has altered their thinking patterns."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "It has harmed their physical development."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "It has limited their brain capacity."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 32,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;'Digital immigrants' tend to access computers",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "using their native language."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "less efficiently than young people."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "for less important information."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 33,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What example is given of having a 'digital accent'?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "having less effective typing skills"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "doing things the old-fashioned way"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "being unable to understand instructions"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
